  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "30年の時を経て、『機動戦士Ζガンダム』に登場するガルバルディβが、完全新規造形で待望の初HGUC化！",
      "en": "After 30 years, the Galbaldy β that appears in \"Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam\" has been made into the long-awaited first HGUC with a completely new model!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 最新フォーマットに合わせ各部ディテールが高密度化され、胴体肩部には内部フレームを思わせるディテールを追加！",
      "en": "• Details of each part have been increased in density to match the latest format, and details reminiscent of the internal frame have been added to the shoulders of the torso!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 胸部下面のモールドは別パーツでディテールを再現！",
      "en": "• The mold on the bottom of the chest reproduces the details with separate parts!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 二の腕に回転軸が追加されアクション性が向上！",
      "en": "• A rotation axis has been added to the upper arm for improved action!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ゲルググと同型のライフルが新規造形で付属するほか、シールドは差替えで伸縮ギミックを再現！",
      "en": "• In addition to a new model of the same type of rifle as Gelgoog, Seal can be replaced to recreate the telescopic gimmick!"
    }
  ],
